description = "The Picocomputer 6502, a modern-retro computer built around a WDC 65C02. This core runs the same programs, distributed as .rp6502 files, that the hardware and the desktop emulators run. Programs may use the keyboard, a mouse, and up to four gamepads. Find software on itch.io under the RP6502 tag."
